2multi_02","Icebreaker All-Rounder Medal II","T1","During Icebreaker Games #2, earn a total of 50 Merit Medals in [Regular Events].","Medal awarded to those who participated in a large number of events in Icebreaker Games #2. Do it enough times, and you'll eventually win one!",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_03","Icebreaker Rookie Medal II","T1","During Icebreaker Games #2, complete 3 [Regular Events: Beginner] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Beginner division in Icebreaker Games #2.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_04","Icebreaker Adept Medal II","T1","During Icebreaker Games #2, complete 3 [Regular Events: Advanced] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Advanced division in Icebreaker Games #2.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_05","Icebreaker Expert Medal II","T2","During Icebreaker Games #2, complete 1 [Regular Events: Expert] with 3 Merit Medals.","Medal awarded to those who performed well in the Expert division in Icebreaker Games #2.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_06","Icebreaker Defense Medal II","T2","During Icebreaker Games #2, battle 2 different Monuments of Trial in Bastion Defense.","Medal awarded to those who protected their position in Bastion Defense in Icebreaker Games #2.\nGrit, determination, courage. These are what make the athletes who show outstanding performance at this event.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_07","Icebreaker Navigator Medal","T2","During Icebreaker Games #2, have 2 Supplies Floaters on the Drifter when clearing Obstacle Drift.","Medal awarded to those who gathered many Supplies Floaters in Obstacle Drift in Icebreaker Games #2.\nThe athletes spare no effort when it comes to Obstacle Drift. The competition is fiery-hot in this event that demands both skill and luck.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_08","Icebreaker Commemorative Medal II","T2","During Icebreaker Games #2, submit 2 sets of photos.","Medal archived with the competition photo reel.\nThe valiant performances of the athletes under the lens, alongside this medal, will serve as eternal mementos of this glorious competition.",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_09","Icebreaker Fame Medal II","T2","During Icebreaker Games #2, earn a total of 20 titles.","Your title, alongside your many accomplishments, has been showered with praise in the arena.\nWhich title of yours is the audience shouting out?",0],["medal_activity_act2multi_10","Icebreaker Style Medal II","T1","During Icebreaker Games #2, obtain the outfit One-man Racing Team","Medal awarded with an outfit. Serves as a tag as well.\nStyle and performance in one. That's the Icebreaker spirit.",0]],"set":["Rhodes Island Icebreaker Games #2 Engraved Medal Set","An engraved medal set commemorating the Rhodes Island Icebreaker Games.\nThe Icebreaker Games are currently developing all-new events while also adding in distinctive challenges, so that operators from all across Terra can take part in the competition with gusto, and forge even deeper bonds of friendship."]}}